# Project Synopsis

## Project Title

**E-Commerce Shopping App UI/UX**

## Introduction

The **E-Commerce Shopping App UI/UX** is a frontend web application designed to provide a modern, responsive, and user-friendly online shopping experience. The project focuses on creating an attractive interface with smooth navigation and interactive features using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.

## Objective

To design and develop a responsive e-commerce shopping interface that allows users to browse products easily through different categories and enjoy a seamless shopping experience.

## Features

* Attractive and responsive UI/UX design
* Home page with banners and discount offers
* Product categories such as **Men, Women, Boys, and Girls**
* Clickable category sections that open dedicated product pages
* Product cards with images, names, prices, and discounts
* Search bar and navigation menu
* Shopping cart interface
* Mobile-friendly design

## Technologies Used

* HTML
* CSS
* JavaScript

## Expected Outcome

The project will demonstrate frontend development skills by creating a visually appealing and interactive shopping website with a smooth user experience and responsive design.
